<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Box Cricket Booking Platform - API Documentation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
        h1 { color: #003365; }
        h2 { color: #004a8f; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f5f8fa; color: #333; font-weight: bold; }
        .method { font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; width: 50px; text-align: center; }
        .get { color: #0b5c0b; }
        .post { color: #8a6d3b; }
        .put { color: #31708f; }
        .delete { color: #a94442; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Box Cricket Booking Platform - API List</h1>
    <p>Complete list of backend endpoints currently active in the microservices architecture.</p>

    <h2>1. City Service (Port 3008)</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/city</td>
            <td>Create a new city (Requires name, state in body)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/city/:status</td>
            <td>Get cities (status = active, inactive, or all)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/city-by-id/:id</td>
            <td>Get a specific city by its ID</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method put">PUT</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/update-city/:id</td>
            <td>Update a city name/state by ID</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method delete">DELETE</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/city/:id</td>
            <td>Soft delete a city (Marks it inactive)</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Category Service (Port 3002)</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/category</td>
            <td>Create a new sport/venue category</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/category/:status</td>
            <td>Get categories (status = active, inactive, or all)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/category-by-id/:id</td>
            <td>Get a specific category by its ID</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method put">PUT</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/update-category/:id</td>
            <td>Update a category name by ID</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method delete">DELETE</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/category/:id</td>
            <td>Soft delete a category</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h2>3. Authentication Service (Port 3001)</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/auth/register</td>
            <td>Register a new user account</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/auth/login</td>
            <td>Login and receive JWT Token</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/auth/me</td>
            <td>Get current authenticated user profile</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h2>4. Owner Request Service (Port 3006)</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Method</th>
            <th>Endpoint</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/owner-request</td>
            <td>Submit a new venue owner KYC request</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
            <td>/api/v1/get-owner-request</td>
            <td>Get all owner verification requests</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>
